CorridorKey for Avid (AVX2 Plugin) — License Notice
====================================================

This repository contains an Avid Media Composer AVX2 host plugin ("the shim")
and packaging scripts that connect to CorridorKey 2.0.

1) Plugin shim and packaging code in this repository
----------------------------------------------------
Unless otherwise noted in a file header, the C++ plugin sources, IPC runtime
wrapper, installer scripts, and documentation authored for this Avid integration
are provided free of charge for personal and community use.

You may use, copy, and redistribute this plugin for free.
You may NOT sell this plugin or charge for access to it without a separate
written agreement.

2) CorridorKey 2.0 engine, weights, and name
--------------------------------------------
CorridorKey 2.0 (code, model weights, and branding) remains under the license
published by Corridor Digital / the CorridorKey 2.0 project:

  https://github.com/nikopueringer/CorridorKey2.0

In summary (always read the upstream LICENSE for the binding terms):
- You may use CorridorKey to process images/video, including commercial footage.
- You may NOT repackage CorridorKey and sell it.
- You may NOT offer CorridorKey inference as a paid API service without agreement.
- Keep the CorridorKey name on forks and releases.
- Commercial integration into a sold software product requires written agreement
  with Corridor Digital (contact@corridordigital.com).
- Organizations above the revenue threshold stated in the upstream LICENSE need
  commercial seats.

3) Avid AVX SDK
---------------
The Avid AVX2 Software Developers’ Kit is proprietary to Avid Technology, Inc.
and is used under Avid’s evaluation (or commercial) license. The SDK is NOT
redistributed by this project. Build machines must obtain it from Avid Developer.

4) Third-party notices
----------------------
See CorridorKey2.0/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for foundation model notices
(C-RADIO, MoGe, RVM, and others).
